    },
    {
      "title": "Taxes come out first",
      "text": "Your employer usually withholds federal and state income taxes, plus Social Security and Medicare taxes. Income tax withholding is an estimate toward your tax bill, not necessarily the exact amount you’ll owe for the year.",
