    "options": [
      {
        "text": "Part of the check may now pay her health insurance premium.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "feedback": "Right. A health insurance premium is a deduction that can reduce take-home pay."
      },
      {
        "text": "Her annual salary is now divided across fewer pay periods.",
